<title>USA: New England to acquire Snyder Capital.</title>
<headline>New England to acquire Snyder Capital.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>New England Investment Cos LP said Tuesday it agreed to acquire Snyder Capital Management Inc, a privately-held San Francisco money management firm.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>New England Investment said Snyder manages funds for endowments, foundations, corporations and high net worth individuals and has more than $1 billion in assets under management.</p>
<p>New England Investment is a money management firm with about $103 billion in assets under management.</p>
</text>
